### POST /v1/querybatch

Source: https://github.com/google/osv.dev/blob/master/docs/api/post-v1-querybatch.md

Query for multiple packages (by either package and version or git commit hash) at once. Returns vulnerability ids and modified field only. The response ordering will be guaranteed to match the input.

```APIDOC
## POST /v1/querybatch

### Description
Query for multiple packages (by either package and version or git commit hash) at once. Returns vulnerability ids and modified field only. The response ordering will be guaranteed to match the input.

### Method
POST

### Endpoint
/v1/querybatch

### Parameters
#### Request Body
- **queries** (array) - Required - An array of query objects. Each query object can specify:
  - **commit** (string) - Optional - A git commit hash.
  - **version** (string) - Optional - A package version.
  - **package** (object) - Optional - Package details:
    - **name** (string) - Required if ecosystem is specified - The name of the package.
    - **ecosystem** (string) - Required if name is specified - The ecosystem of the package (e.g., "PyPI").
    - **purl** (string) - Optional - The Package URL.
  - **page_token** (string) - Optional - For pagination.

*Note: Each query item must follow the same rules as `/v1/query`. Use either `version` or a versioned purl, not both. Items with both will return **400 Bad Request**.*

### Request Example
```bash
cat <<EOF | curl -d @- "https://api.osv.dev/v1/querybatch"
{
  "queries": [
    {
      "package": {
        "purl": "pkg:pypi/mlflow@0.4.0"
      }
    },
    {
      "commit": "6879efc2c1596d11a6a6ad296f80063b558d5e0f"
    },
    {
      "package": {
        "ecosystem": "PyPI",
        "name": "jinja2"
      },
      "version": "2.4.1"
    }
  ]
}
EOF
```

### Response
#### Success Response (200)
- **results** (array) - An array of vulnerability results, matching the order of the input queries.
  - Each element in the `results` array is an object that may contain:
    - **vulns** (array) - A list of vulnerabilities found for the query.
      - **id** (string) - The ID of the vulnerability.
      - **modified** (string) - The timestamp when the vulnerability was last modified.

