### POST /v1/querybatch

Source: https://github.com/google/osv.dev/blob/master/docs/api/post-v1-querybatch.md

The POST /v1/querybatch endpoint allows querying for multiple packages simultaneously using either their version or a git commit hash. The response will only include vulnerability IDs and the modified field, and the order of results will correspond to the order of the input queries.
